://api.github.com/users/x-rush","html_url":"https://github.com/x-rush","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x-rush/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x-rush/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x-rush/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x-rush/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x-rush/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x-rush/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x-rush/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x-rush/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/x-rush/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T03:26:25Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T03:26:25Z","body":"非常需要，不要逼我跪下来求你们。😢😢😢","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/2680330081/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/2681322354","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/106#issuecomment-2681322354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/106","id":2681322354,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc6f0bty","user":{"login":"metacode0602","id":148085875,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNOccw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/148085875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/metacode0602","html_url":"https://github.com/metacode0602","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metacode0602/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metacode0602/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metacode0602/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metacode0602/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metacode0602/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metacode0602/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metacode0602/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metacode0602/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/metacode0602/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T09:36:34Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T09:36:34Z","body":"首先需要安装Open Remote - WSL扩展，安装后目前无法使用的。然后按照以下操作：\n\n1、进入wsl的控制台\n2、进入目录 /root/.trae-server/bin/6ffaa95deab062345990d228a7ef3c02b83f0001\n3、下载\n\n```shell\n\nwget https://github.com/VSCodium/vscodium/releases/download/1.97.2.25045/VSCodium-linux-x64-1.97.2.25045.tar.gz\n\n```\n\n4、执行命令进行就解压\n\n```shell\n\nmv VSCodium-linux-x64-1.97.2.25045.tar.gz vscode-server.tar.gz\n\ntar -xf vscode-server.tar.gz --strip-components 1\n\n```\n5、修改配置信息\n在当前目录下找到product.json，当中有一个字段 commit，将其值改为：`6ffaa95deab062345990d228a7ef3c02b83f0001`\n\n```json\n\n{\n  \"commit\": \"6ffaa95deab062345990d228a7ef3c02b83f0001\",   //6ffaa95deab062345990d228a7ef3c02b83f0001\n  \"date\": \"2025-02-14T18:21:12.766Z\",\n  \"version\": \"1.97.2\",\n  \"release\": \"25045\"\n}\n\n```\n\n保证commit的值和上面`/root/.trae-server/bin/6ffaa95deab062345990d228a7ef3c02b83f0001` 中 `6ffaa95deab062345990d228a7ef3c02b83f0001` 的一致。\n\n6、重新命名trae-server\n\n```shell    \nmv ./bin/codium-server ./bin/trae-server\n```\n\n7、创建必要的文件\n\n从错误日志中找到必要的 token信息，`SERVER_CONNECTION_TOKEN=\"1b533671-0739-46c7-bcdc-7ea1d096a9dd\"`,创建必要的文件。\n\n```shell\nmkdir -p $HOME/.trae-server\ntouch $HOME/.trae-server/.6ffaa95deab062345990d228a7ef3c02b83f0001.token\ntouch $HOME/.trae-server/.6ffaa95deab062345990d228a7ef3c02b83f0001.log\n\necho $SERVER_CONNECTION_TOKEN > .6ffaa95deab062345990d228a7ef3c02b83f0001.token\n\n\n```\n\n8、启动trae-server\n\n```shell\n./bin/trae-server --start-server --host=127.0.0.1 --port=0 --connection-token-file $HOME/.trae-server/.6ffaa95deab062345990d228a7ef3c02b83f0001.token --telemetry-level off --use-host-proxy --disable-websocket-compression --without-browser-env-var --enable-remote-auto-shutdown --accept-server-license-terms &> $HOME/.trae-server/.6ffaa95deab062345990d228a7ef3c02b83f0001.log &\n\n```\n\n9、启动Trae，打开wsl客户端，成功了！","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/2681322354/reactions","total_count":15,"+1":10,"-1":2,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/2681751343","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/106#issuecomment-2681751343","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/106","id":2681751343,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc6f2Ecv","user":{"login":"ChoiiYill","id":59330123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MzMwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59330123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChoiiYill","html_url":"https://github.com/ChoiiYill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChoiiYill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChoiiYill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChoiiYill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChoiiYill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChoiiYill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChoiiYill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChoiiYill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChoiiYill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChoiiYill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T12:09:31Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T12:09:31Z","body":"> 首先需要安装Open Remote - WSL扩展，安装后目前无法使用的。然后按照以下操作：\n> \n> 1、进入wsl的控制台 2、进入目录 /root/.trae-server/bin/6ffaa95deab062345990d228a7ef3c02b83f000