f7826 使用以下命令将当前的版本号替换成上面的id\n> \n> grep -rl \"06487dbc453a56dbaa4ce833d9d062396e7f7826\" | xargs sed -i 's/06487dbc453a56dbaa4ce833d9d062396e7f7826/091f8a0caee351471824364161d71b665bb832ae/g'\n> 5. 重新打开trae连接wsl就正常了\n> \n> ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df5e47e7-0b12-48b2-9cb3-b760a2cdea31)\n> \n> 不过好像wsl里面装不了插件，只能看代码以及代码高亮，没有代码提示和操作代码\n\n\n\n> 1. 先把trae升级成最新版本，再安装wsl插件，会提示以下错误\n> \n> ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a45b13b-01d6-4c8f-b9c6-ddd72e3754c1) 2. 用以下方法解决\n> \n>  cd $HOME/.trae-server/bin\n> ls查看当前的id是多少，我的是091f8a0caee351471824364161d71b665bb832ae\n> \n> cd 091f8a0caee351471824364161d71b665bb832ae\n> wget https://github.com/VSCodium/vscodium/releases/download/1.96.4.25026/vscodium-reh-linux-x64-1.96.4.25026.tar.gz\n> mv vscodium-reh-linux-x64-1.96.4.25026.tar.gz vscode-server.tar.gz\n> tar -xf vscode-server.tar.gz --strip-components 1\n> mv bin/codium-server bin/trae-server\n> 3. 重新打开trae连接wsl，报版本不对，点击错误上面`在浏览器打开`,可以看到当前版本\n> \n> ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a11dcd7-ed5f-4b90-8bf3-f58d98658050) 4. 复制上面的版本号，我的是06487dbc453a56dbaa4ce833d9d062396e7f7826 使用以下命令将当前的版本号替换成上面的id\n> \n> grep -rl \"06487dbc453a56dbaa4ce833d9d062396e7f7826\" | xargs sed -i 's/06487dbc453a56dbaa4ce833d9d062396e7f7826/091f8a0caee351471824364161d71b665bb832ae/g'\n> 5. 重新打开trae连接wsl就正常了\n> \n> ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df5e47e7-0b12-48b2-9cb3-b760a2cdea31)\n> \n> 不过好像wsl里面装不了插件，只能看代码以及代码高亮，没有代码提示和操作代码\n\n按照你的指引，我成功连接到了WSL2","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/2692023139/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]}